#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:2
msgid "查看报警记录"
msgstr "View alarm records"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:4
msgid ""
"您可以在 **实时警报** 页面查看当前产生的报警条目，点击任意一条即可打开报警详情。 也可以通过顶部导航进入 **历史** "
"页面，查看所有历史报警记录并支持筛选与导出。"
msgstr ""
"You can view the currently generated alarm entries on the **Real-time "
"Alarm** page, and click on any one to open the alarm details.You can also "
"enter the **History** page through the top navigation to view all historical"
" alarm records and support filtering and exporting."

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:7
msgid "报警详情包含以下信息："
msgstr "Alarm details include the following information:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:9
msgid "报警详情页面"
msgstr "Alarm details page"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:14
msgid "事件可视化图片：在详情页可播放事件发生前后 **15 秒** 的视频片段；"
msgstr ""
"Event visualization pictures: **15 seconds** video clips before and after "
"the event can be played on the details page;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:15
msgid "记录基础信息："
msgstr "Record basic information:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:16
msgid "事件 ID"
msgstr "Event ID"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:17
msgid "发生时间"
msgstr "Occurrence time"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:18
msgid "摄像头 ID"
msgstr "Camera ID"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:19
msgid "摄像头名称"
msgstr "Camera name"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:20
msgid "警报类型（由工作流里的事件记录模块定义）"
msgstr "Alert type (defined by the event recording module in the workflow)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:21
msgid "视频 URL"
msgstr "Video URL"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:22
msgid "当前状态"
msgstr "Current status"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:23
msgid "反馈状态"
msgstr "feedback status"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:24
msgid "原始图片下载"
msgstr "Original image download"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:27
msgid "在详情页面的操作"
msgstr "Operations on the details page"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:29
msgid "确认并处理警报：操作员可将报警标记为 **已解决**；"
msgstr ""
"Acknowledge and handle alerts: Operators can mark alerts as **resolved**;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:30
msgid "添加备注：记录现场检查情况或处理建议，便于后续追踪；"
msgstr ""
"Add notes: record the on-site inspection situation or processing suggestions"
" to facilitate follow-up tracking;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:31
msgid "变更状态：从“待检查”切换为“处理中 / 已解决”等，纳入流程化管理。"
msgstr ""
"Change status: Switch from \"pending inspection\" to "
"\"processing/resolved\", etc., and incorporate it into process management."

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:34
msgid "历史记录筛选与查询"
msgstr "Historical record filtering and querying"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:36
msgid "在 **历史** 页面，支持使用过滤器进行精准查询："
msgstr "On the **History** page, filters are supported for precise query:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:38
msgid "按日期范围；"
msgstr "by date range;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:39
msgid "按摄像头名称；"
msgstr "Press camera name;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:40
msgid "按工作流名称；"
msgstr "By workflow name;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:41
msgid "按状态（待检查 / 处理中 / 已解决等）；"
msgstr "By status (to be checked/processing/resolved, etc.);"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:42
msgid "按事件类型（如“人员离岗”“进入禁区”等）。"
msgstr ""
"By event type (such as \"personnel leaving the post\", \"entering the "
"restricted area\", etc.)."

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:44
msgid "报警历史页面"
msgstr "Alarm history page"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:49
msgid "提示：支持导出查询结果为 CSV/JSON（若已在系统中启用），便于报表与复盘。"
msgstr ""
"Tip: Supports exporting query results to CSV/JSON (if enabled in the system)"
" to facilitate reporting and review."

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:52
msgid "数据导出"
msgstr "Data export"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:54
msgid "报警导出功能"
msgstr "Alarm export function"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:59
msgid "在页面右上角的 **设置** → **导出** 中，可以导出报警事件数据；"
msgstr ""
"In **Settings** → **Export** in the upper right corner of the page, you can "
"export alarm event data;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:60
msgid "支持先使用过滤器筛选（按日期、摄像头、工作流、状态、事件类型），再导出对应的报警记录；"
msgstr ""
"Supports filtering (by date, camera, workflow, status, event type) first, "
"and then exporting the corresponding alarm records;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/alarm_management.rst:61
msgid "导出格式为 **CSV** 文件，便于在 Excel 或 BI 工具中进行统计分析。"
msgstr ""
"Export format is **CSV** file for easy statistical analysis in Excel or BI "
"tools."
